{
    "name": {
        "ara": "طَلَعَ الْبَدْرُ عَلَيْنَا",
        "en": "ṬalaʿA l-Badru ʿAlaynā - The (full) White Moon Rose Over Us"
    },
    "verses": {
        "ara": [
            "طَلَعَ الْبَدْرُ عَلَيْنَا",
            "مِنْ ثَنِيَّاتِ الْوَدَاعْ",
            "وَجَبَ الشُّكْرُ عَلَيْنَا",
            "مَا دَعَا لِلّٰهِ دَاعْ",

            "أَيُّهَا الْمَبْعُوثُ فِينَا",
            "جِئْتَ بِالْأَمْرِ الْمُطَاعْ",
            "جِئْتَ شَرَّفْتَ الْمَدِينَةْ",
            "مَرْحَبًا يَا خَيْرَ دَاعْ",

            "بَيْنَ كَتْفَهِ عَلَامَةْ",
            "خَاتِمُ الرُّسْلِ الْكِرَامْ",

            "أَشْرَقَ الْبَدْرُ عَلَيْنَا",
            "وَاخْتَفَى بَدْرُ التَّمَامْ",

            "مِثْلَ حُسْنِكْ مَا رَأَيْنَا",
            "فِي الْعِرَاقَيْنِ وَشَامْ",

            "رَبِّ فَاجْعَلْ مُجْتَمَعْنَا",
            "غَايَتُهْ حُسْنُ الْخِتَامْ",

            "وَاعْطِنَا مَا قَدْ سَأَلْنَا",
            "مِنْ عَطَايَاكَ الْجِسَامْ",

            "وَاكْرِمِ الْأَرْوَاحَ مِنَّا",
            "بِلِّقَاءْ خَيْرِ الْأَنَامْ",

            "وَابْلِغِ الْمُخْتَارَ عَنَّا",
            "مِنْ صَلَاةٍ وَسَلَامْ"
        ],
        "en": [
            "ṭalaʿa l-badru ʿalaynā",
            "min thaniyyāti l-wadāʿ",
            "wajaba sh-shukru ʿalaynā",
            "mā daʿā lillāhi dāʿ",

            "ayyuha l-mabʿūthu fīnā",
            "jiʾta bil-amri l-muṭāʿ",
            "jiʾta sharrafta l-madīnah",
            "marḥaban yā khayra dāʿ",

            "bayna katfahi ʿalāmah",
            "khātimu r-rusli l-kirām",

            "ashraqa l-badru ʿalaynā",
            "wa-khtafā badru t-tamām",

            "mithla ḥusnik mā raʾaynā",
            "fi l-ʿirāqayni wa-shām",

            "rabbi fajʿal mujtamaʿnā",
            "ghāyatuh ḥusnu l-khitām",

            "wa-ʿṭinā mā qad saʾalnā",
            "min ʿaṭāyāka l-jisām",

            "wa-krimi l-arwāḥa minnā",
            "billiqāʾ khayri l-anām",

            "wa-blighi l-mukhtāra ʿannā",
            "min ṣalātin wa-salām"
        ]
    },
    "translation": {
        "en": [
            "O the white moon rose over us,",
            "from the valley of Wadāʿ",
            "And we owe it to show gratefulness,",
            "where the call is to Allah",

            "O you who were raised amongst us,",
            "coming with a word to be obeyed",
            "You have brought to this city nobleness,",
            "welcome best caller to God's way",

            "Between his shoulder blades is a distinguished mark:",
            "[for he is] the Seal of all the Noble Messengers",

            "The full moon has illumined us,",
            "and all other moons have been totally eclipsed",

            "The likeness of your beauty we have never seen,",
            "not in Iraq nor the Levant",

            "My Lord, make the final outcome of our gathering",
            "a beautiful seal [to our lives]",

            "And grant us all that we asked for,",
            "from Your Immense, Overflowing Gifts",

            "And ennoble our spirits immeasurably,",
            "[by granting us] a meeting with the Best of Creation",

            "And convey to the Chosen One",
            "blessings and salutations from us"
        ]
    },
